{
  "bookId": "hero-214005",
  "id": "bond-27529",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27529001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "主公，似乎兴致不高。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，有人要割我的肉，吃我的血。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "翻译过来，便是要我大出血的意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "哦？所为何事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为了应付一个坏东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你瞅瞅这个，满意吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "原来在下便是主公眼中的坏东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不愧是光秀，果然机智如你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你在笑什么？笑得和狐狸似的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "只是忽然想到了一些有趣的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "这份礼，在下厚颜收下了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27529014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "往后，也将会有一份礼回赠主公。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
